  "about.title": "About this tracker",
  "about.body": "A static, offline-friendly companion for tracking your Fire Emblem Heroes collection. No account, no server; everything lives in this browser.",
  "about.dataTitle": "Data source",
  "about.dataBody": "Hero catalogue and portraits come from the Fire Emblem Heroes Wiki (feheroes.fandom.com), served under CC BY-SA. Portraits are hotlinked from the wiki CDN.",
  "about.updateTitle": "Catalogue updates",
  "about.updateBody": "The catalogue is regenerated weekly by a GitHub Action (and on demand from the Actions tab); new heroes appear on their own after redeploy. Heroes not yet on the wiki can be added by editing data/heroes.overrides.json in the repo.",
  "about.privacyTitle": "Privacy",
  "about.privacyBody": "Your collection is stored only in your browser's localStorage. Use Export / Import to back it up or move it between devices. Nothing is sent anywhere.",
  "about.legalTitle": "Legal",
  "about.legalBody": "Fire Emblem and Fire Emblem Heroes are trademarks of Nintendo / Intelligent Systems. This is an unofficial fan project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Nintendo. All hero names, art and assets belong to their respective owners.",
